WEBVTT

00:36:27.163 --> 00:36:33.288
But the other piece of this I want to say
is that I prepared to the extent that

00:36:33.288 --> 00:36:36.038
I could that there wasn't the Internet.

00:36:36.038 --> 00:36:39.913
You know, I went to the Minneapolis
Public Library and said, you know,

00:36:39.913 --> 00:36:43.204
what books do you have on the Pacific
Crest Trail? And they had one.

00:36:43.204 --> 00:36:44.746
And it was the book I already
purchased at.

00:36:45.288 --> 00:36:48.871
It wasn't it wasn't like
things were available.

00:36:48.871 --> 00:36:53.913
You know, you just had to go and see how
it was. Yeah, I was absolutely alone.

00:36:53.913 --> 00:36:57.121
I was the first eight days of my hike.
I didn't even see another person.

00:36:57.454 --> 00:37:00.954
What I learned is that that would be,
you know, a regular thing like that.